<section class="hero">
  <h1>The Bitcoin <em>Hurdle Rate</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Every capital decision is a comparison against the next-best use of the money. For anyone who holds bitcoin, or could, its trend growth is a candidate benchmark. <strong>Does it beat bitcoin?</strong> &mdash; if the trend holds, and the capital can wait.</p>
  <p class="hero-lead">A tool for CFOs, treasurers, and individual holders weighing a capital decision: enter the return you&rsquo;re testing and the horizon of the decision, and see bitcoin&rsquo;s trend hurdle matched to that horizon &mdash; and where your number crosses it. The hurdle is derived from bitcoin&rsquo;s long-run <a href="/the-power-law.html">Power Law trend</a>, the same model, read at the horizon you choose.</p>
</section>

